  "title": "Estate Dryer",
  "revisionid": 1149235,
  "contents_raw": "== Background and Identification ==\n\nEstate is a brand of home appliances that is owned by Whirlpool Corporation, one of the world's largest manufacturers of home appliances. The Estate brand was introduced in 1970, and since then, it has built a reputation for producing affordable and reliable appliances for the home with a no-nonsense approach to design. They have incorporated various features in their dryers over the years, such as AutoDry technology, which uses sensors to stop the dryer and prevent over-drying, wrinkle control option, and variable timed drying.\n\nIn 2019, the Estate EED4400WQ dryer was named a \"Best Buy\" by Consumer Reports, an independent consumer organization that provides ratings and reviews of products. The Estate EED4400WQ was praised for its affordability, ease of use, and ability to handle large loads. Estate has also been recognized for its commitment to sustainability with their range of energy-efficient dryers that were certified by Energy Star.\n\n***Common Models:***\n\nEED4400WQ[br]\nEGD4300TQ[br]\nEED4300TQ\n\n== Identification ==\n\nThe model number of an Estate brand dryer can typically be found on a label located on the inside of the dryer door, on the back of the control panel, or on the back of the dryer itself. Look for a white or silver sticker with black printing that contains a combination of letters and numbers. The model number may also be listed in the owner's manual.\n\n== Additional Information ==\n\n***Estate (Whirlpool) Customer Support Line*** ***US:*** 1-866-698-2538[br]\n***Estate (Whirlpool) Customer Support Line Canada***: 1-800-807-6777",
